Formal Conjectures
-----------------
The sequence definition and problem statement in LeanA113258/Defs.lean and
LeanA113258/Conjecture.lean are adapted from:
https://github.com/google-deepmind/formal-conjectures/blob/main/FormalConjectures/OEIS/113258.lean

Copyright 2026 The Formal Conjectures Authors.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Project modifications replace the factorial and finite-sum implementation
with recursive definitions, express the question using IsPerfectPower,
and add reduction lemmas and the proof of nonexistence for n > 4.

Build dependencies
------------------
Mathlib, Batteries, Aesop, Qq, Plausible, LeanSearchClient, import-graph,
and ProofWidgets use Apache-2.0. The lean4-cli dependency uses MIT
(Copyright (c) 2021 mhuisi). Their source distributions are fetched
separately by Lake and are not bundled in this repository. The pinned
versions and upstream URLs are recorded in lake-manifest.json.

